  by: agent  # 10ba
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 10ba
  clock: 9  # 10ba
  nonce: 10ba  # 10ba
  message: "Fixed in PR #1469 (stage 9a), together with WI-faful. Loop headers (for-each variable, classic for init/update, Go range clause) and if/switch initializers (incl. Go 'if err := cmd.Run(); err != nil') are now CFG statements that define their bindings before the body, in all six DDG languages. Behavioural evidence (verify-claims fixtures, losod.md): Go if-initializer, Go range over os.Environ(), Go for-clause, Rust for, TS for-of/for, C for: structural -> ddg/confirmed; Python for and Java for-each/for: not_attempted -> ddg/confirmed; controls (header source, constant-fed sink) read escaped. Mutations (drop Go range header, drop body cut-off) revert them. Six-repo A/B: 2 evidence rows moved to ddg/confirmed, no verdict moved (branch run, not re-measured on dev): tagged awaits_bakeoff_validation. Residuals filed: WI-nohuv (except-as, match-case, type switch, select, catch), WI-sozob (switch without default), WI-nogil (C bare declaration)."  # 10ba
